# Adept of Taste (Q330): a level 24 character accepts at Jonas, who has nothing to cook yet, and
# Mirien sends the player back while the ingredient list is still out. Each supplier hands out his
# book, contract or list and sends the player away once with one short; the character already holds
# one item short of each count. Sonia: a sprout's red root (roll 0), a sprout's white root (roll
# 75), a sprout past both chances (roll 80) and a wild sprout's red root past its count give the
# white mandragora sap. Jacob: a bloody bee's nectar (roll 0), Jacob offers plain honey (the player
# says no), a stinger wasp's royal jelly (roll 85) and a wasp past both chances (roll 97) give the
# golden honey. Pano: a hobgoblin's amulet gives the Dion potato. Glyvka: a gray ant's green moss
# and a giant crimson ant's brown moss (roll 9) give the brown moss bundle. Rollant: a searcher's
# two bodies (roll 0) and a gazer's two, cut to the one missing (roll 9), give the floating eye
# meat. With three special ingredients and the even roll pinned to true, Jonas cooks the fifth steak
# dish (the jackpot), Mirien reviews it, and Jonas pays for the review as the repeatable quest ends;
# then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
